    <main class="w-full">
      <div id="content" class="container opacity-0"><section data-section-type="text_and_single_image" data-section-id="pg010_sec002" class="bg-white text-gray-900"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 py-8 max-sm:px-5"><div class="flex items-center gap-0 max-sm:items-start"><div aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-44 w-36 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-l-2xl rounded-r-xl bg-purple-500 text-white max-lg:h-36 max-lg:w-28 max-sm:h-24 max-sm:w-20"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" class="h-16 w-16 fill-current max-sm:h-12 max-sm:w-12" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="7"/><circle cx="32" cy="16" r="8"/><circle cx="44" cy="20" r="7"/><path d="M11 43c0-7 5-13 12-13s12 6 12 13v3H11z"/><path d="M20 46c0-9 6-16 12-16s12 7 12 16v0H20z"/><path d="M33 46c0-7 5-13 12-13s12 6 12 13v0H33z"/></svg></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 pt-10 max-lg:pt-7 max-sm:pt-2"><div class="bg-purple-500 px-4 py-3 text-white"><h1 class="adt-h1 font-bold leading-tight"><span data-id="pg010_n0008">Lidhjet dhe bashk&#xeb;punimi me t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t</span></h1></div><div class="max-w-[32rem] border-b-4 border-purple-400 px-4 py-3 max-lg:max-w-[28rem] max-sm:max-w-full"><h2 class="adt-h2 font-medium leading-tight text-gray-900"><span data-id="pg010_n0009">Grupet shoq&#xeb;rore</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl space-y-6 px-8 pb-10 max-sm:px-5"><div class="pt-2"><h3 class="adt-h3 inline-block bg-green-400 px-4 py-1 font-medium text-gray-900"><span data-id="pg010_n0011">Situata 1.</span></h3></div><p class="adt-body text-left leading-relaxed text-gray-800"><span data-id="pg010_n0013">Bora, s&#xeb; bashku me prind&#xeb;rit dhe v&#xeb;llan&#xeb; e madh, jeton n&#xeb; Prishtin&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg010_n0014">Ajo &#xeb;sht&#xeb; n&#xeb; klas&#xeb;n e kat&#xeb;rt.</span> <span data-id="pg010_n0015">N&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;n e saj ka shum&#xeb; grupe ku f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t bashkohen, sepse mendojn&#xeb; nj&#xeb;soj, kan&#xeb; d&#xeb;shira e interesa t&#xeb; nj&#xeb;jt&#xeb; dhe duan t&#xeb; arrijn&#xeb; gj&#xeb;ra t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;ta.</span> <span data-id="pg010_n0016">K&#xeb;to grupe t&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;s u mund&#xeb;sojn&#xeb; nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sve q&#xeb; t&apos;i shprehin aft&#xeb;sit&#xeb; dhe talentet e tyre t&#xeb; ndryshme.</span> <span data-id="pg010_n0017">Bora &#xeb;sht&#xeb; pjes&#xeb;tare e grupit t&#xeb; vall&#xeb;zimit dhe atij t&#xeb; recitimit.</span> <span data-id="pg010_n0018">Nd&#xeb;rsa, v&#xeb;llai i saj &#xeb;sht&#xeb; pjes&#xeb;tar i grupit t&#xeb; futbollit dhe atij t&#xeb; piktur&#xeb;s.</span> <span data-id="pg010_n0019">N&#xeb; k&#xeb;to grupe, ata m&#xeb;sojn&#xeb; shum&#xeb; gj&#xeb;ra t&#xeb; reja, duke bashk&#xeb;punuar me nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin.</span></p><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-none bg-amber-50"><img data-id="pg010_im002" src="images/pg010_im002.png" alt="F&#xeb;mij&#xeb; t&#xeb; veshur me kostume tradicionale vall&#xeb;zojn&#xeb; s&#xeb; bashku n&#xeb; rreth, t&#xeb; kapur p&#xeb;r dore." class="h-auto w-full object-contain"></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-purple-200/70 px-8 py-6 max-sm:px-4"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-0 top-0 z-10 flex h-20 w-20 -translate-x-3 items-center justify-center bg-purple-500 text-white max-sm:h-16 max-sm:w-16"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" class="h-12 w-12 fill-current"><path d="M32 50a5 5 0 1 1 0 10 5 5 0 0 1 0-10Zm-9-33c1-9 9-15 19-13 8 2 13 8 13 16 0 11-10 14-14 18-2 2-3 4-3 7h-9c0-5 1-8 4-11 5-5 12-7 12-14 0-4-3-7-8-8-5-1-10 2-11 8z"/></svg></div><div class="relative z-0 pl-16 max-sm:pl-12"><div class="space-y-3 text-gray-800"><div class="h-4 w-11/12 rounded bg-white/50"></div><div class="h-4 w-10/12 rounded bg-white/50"></div><div class="h-4 w-9/12 rounded bg-white/50"></div><div class="h-4 w-8/12 rounded bg-white/50"></div><div class="h-4 w-11/12 rounded bg-white/50"></div></div></div></div><div class="border border-purple-400 bg-white p-4 max-sm:p-3"><div class="mb-4 flex items-start gap-4 max-sm:flex-col max-sm:items-start max-sm:gap-3"><div aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-20 w-20 shrink-0 items-center justify-center bg-purple-500 text-white max-sm:h-16 max-sm:w-16"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" class="h-12 w-12 fill-none stroke-current" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 10h22l8 8v34a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H18a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V12a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"/><path d="M40 10v10h10"/><path d="M22 48h20"/><path d="M22 42h20"/></svg></div><p class="adt-body text-left italic leading-relaxed text-gray-800"><span data-id="pg010_n0022">Njeriu &#xeb;sht&#xeb; qenie q&#xeb; jeton dhe punon me t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t.</span> <span data-id="pg010_n0023">Ai &#xeb;sht&#xeb; gjithmon&#xeb; pjes&#xeb; e ndonj&#xeb; grupi shoq&#xeb;ror, si p&#xeb;r shembull: familje, grup i shok&#xeb;ve e shoqeve n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;, grup i shok&#xeb;ve e shoqeve n&#xeb; vendin e pun&#xeb;s etj.</span></p></div><div class="space-y-6 pl-0"><p class="adt-body text-left italic leading-relaxed text-gray-800"><span data-id="pg010_n0025">Grupi shoq&#xeb;ror p&#xeb;rb&#xeb;het nga dy ose m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; njer&#xeb;z q&#xeb; b&#xeb;jn&#xeb; di&#xe7;ka s&#xeb; bashku, si p&#xeb;r shembull: kan&#xeb; q&#xeb;llime t&#xeb; ngjashme, kan&#xeb; nevoja dhe interesa t&#xeb; nj&#xeb;jt&#xeb;, mendojn&#xeb; nj&#xeb;soj, ose kan&#xeb; t&#xeb; nj&#xeb;jtin profesion.</span></p><p class="adt-body text-left italic leading-relaxed text-gray-800"><span data-id="pg010_n0027">Njeriu mund t&#xeb; jet&#xeb; pjes&#xeb; e shum&#xeb; grupeve n&#xeb; t&#xeb; nj&#xeb;jt&#xeb;n koh&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg010_n0028">P&#xeb;r shembull, ai &#xeb;sht&#xeb; pjes&#xeb; e familjes, i klas&#xeb;s n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;, i lagjes ku banon, i nj&#xeb; grupi t&#xeb; sportit, t&#xeb; k&#xeb;ndimit ose t&#xeb; vall&#xeb;zimit etj.</span></p><p class="adt-body text-left italic leading-relaxed text-gray-800"><span data-id="pg010_n0030">N&#xeb; t&#xeb; kaluar&#xeb;n, njer&#xeb;zit nuk kishin t&#xeb; nj&#xeb;jtat ide dhe grupe si sot.</span> <span data-id="pg010_n0031">Sot ka shum&#xeb; m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; grupe, sepse jan&#xeb; zhvilluar teknologjia, ekonomia dhe m&#xeb;nyra se si jetojm&#xeb;.</span></p></div></div><div class="border-l-4 border-purple-400 pl-3"><p class="adt-body text-left text-gray-900"><span data-id="pg010_n0034" class="font-semibold">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span> <span data-id="pg010_n0035">grup shoq&#xeb;ror, dikur, sot, q&#xeb;llim i p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;t.</span></p></div></div></section></div>
